.TH OLLAMA\-MESH-NODES 1 "2026-08-17" "ollama-mesh dev" "ollama-mesh Manual"
.SH NAME
ollama\-mesh-nodes \- list nodes known to the mesh
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ollama\-mesh nodes
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
list nodes known to the mesh
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B confirm\-tls <node>
pin a Node Agent's TLS certificate fingerprint (headless enrollment)
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-fingerprint string
SHA-256 fingerprint the operator has independently confirmed matches the node's actual TLS certificate (see "agent service status" on the node), in the form SHA256:<64 hex characters> (required)
.RE
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MESH_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MESH_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MESH_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBollama\-mesh\fR(1)
